<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese Coast Guard and People\'s Liberation Army Navy vessels intensified presence in the West Philippine Sea, with the Armed Forces monitoring 48 vessels across four key features from November 17 to 23, more than double the previous count. The Philippine Coast Guard added three locally built survey ships and three new vessels, BRP Patag, BRP Pag-asa and BRP Kalikasan, expanding its fleet alongside US patrol boats. Manila also deepened maritime cooperation, conducting joint naval exercises with France in the Sulu Sea and receiving five new Coast Guard vessels through a partnership with Japan. 176 battle-related deaths were reported in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQa210ekw2a3g3djVNREJjdHQwVzUxZ2YyTnRQMk8ybk81UHpscWtkWll0VzVxNGdobE82SWktRzNCdk5VYTVReHdZcW1KbkNzekFpWDFMNUxFUk1LV1BlR01vWjc3RGxlWkpNMUtvenoycnVTX0QtV1o1REZ6bmxGdllEa1FWejhLN1Z0VEdNOW53aEFjdHNWSnV2Zm5LR196S2J5RUR0a2paTEVDbl8xZ2xqSXJJZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Manila Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNNjVNaTQ3SnM5ajZqZDBnSFJFVjdZQlhpNmQxZ3NtYmNjYlRJRFgxdzFxcjFwanRhVi0xYnU3N0xNZ1NpNXl6MjJTTWJZQm1TWXlwVU5sU0QtRnJVVE5TOERsYWpKWnY3TGhjVnFXUjk1OGpTc1VVclE3MVhidi13elFNaEUtcmNBUW43d3JndmZfb3RWTkVnVDdhRml0X1YxSFNycG45SldXNW8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQMXJ2WGJVNTFsMFdJYW9BWkhuRkFBZjdtZHpUX0RmVldSaHdMazVSbHZxSjVaUFcwZGVRYzdCNXFMczJEVVdvZWtzY3RkYmhzSl9mQmNUY2NYSnpGQWxpUEVYenVnNy1UWDROaEdGUjF0eDgzMjRoTDgwbVJ6WTBGcEhnSjlvX0FRYjkzQg?oc=5&quot;&gt;jiji press&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxN